    "title": "WV Secretary of State responds to Fayette County vote dispute - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Caleb Pearl ,\n5 hours ago Fayette County, WV (WOAY) – West Virginia Secretary of State Kris Warner spoke with Newswatch 4 following a Tuesday special Fayette County Commission meeting in which Fayette County Republican candidate William Vest was told that 38 votes were illegally cast in his executive committee primary race, a number he says exceeded the margin between him and the next candidate. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
